{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24386","headline":"和令狐仆射小饮听阮咸 · 白居易","name":"和令狐仆射小饮听阮咸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掩抑复凄清，非琴不是筝。\n还弹乐府曲，别占阮家名。\n古调何人识，初闻满座惊。\n落盘珠历历，摇佩玉琤琤。\n似劝杯中物，如含林下情。\n时移音律改，岂是昔时声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}